  {
   "text": "In nineteen nineteen,",
   "s": 0.0,
   "e": 2.129
  },
  {
   "text": "a wave of sweet brown goo killed twenty-one people in Boston.",
   "s": 2.289,
   "e": 4.979
  },
  {
   "text": "A huge tank held over two million gallons of molasses.",
   "s": 5.304,
   "e": 8.615
  },
  {
   "text": "It stood in the middle of a busy neighborhood.",
   "s": 8.831,
   "e": 10.704
  },
  {
   "text": "It was built fast, and it was never tested.",
   "s": 10.946,
   "e": 13.089
  },
  {
   "text": "On a warm January afternoon, the tank groaned.",
